      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who are Black or who are perceived to be Black, as it uses the racial slur 'cracker' to demean them. The visual of the crackers in the gourmet dish serves as a stereotypical association with Black people, reinforcing the slur's harmful intent. The meme leverages racialized language and historical stereotypes to insult and belittle its target audience, making it explicitly aimed at Black individuals or those who identify with the community targeted by this slur.",
